Z||000000||BAM-BAM||03-02-2000||08:54 PM||||   I'm having a problem with my tachometer. When I'm driving on the highway or at idle, the tach jumps around erratically. I have seen other post's about similar problems and it was mentioned that perhaps the tach filter was bad. Just where, exactly, is the tach filter? My chiltons manual doesn't make reference to it or where it might be. Any advice would help.<P>Thanx BAM-BAM||||reg||5
Z||000001||daved||03-02-2000||09:35 PM||||Bam, Its the small tubular thing with 3 wires (one to ground) bolted to the heat sheild, just in front of the coil. (V6)||||reg||1
